---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Jake Reddy | Full-Stack Developer"
  description="Five years building full-stack products — from API design to pixel-perfect interfaces — with a focus on clarity and craft."
>
  <section class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 py-10 md:px-8 md:py-16 lg:px-12 lg:py-20">
    <p class="font-body text-sm text-[#595959] uppercase tracking-[1px] mb-2">Full-Stack Developer</p>
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold mb-4 md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl leading-tight">Jake Reddy</h1>
    <p class="font-body text-lg text-gray-700 max-w-xl leading-relaxed mb-8">
      Five years building full-stack products — from API design to pixel-perfect interfaces — with a focus on clarity and craft.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-[#E5E5E5] max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 py-8 md:px-8 md:py-12 lg:px-12">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold mb-6">Highlights</h2>
    <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <li class="border border-[#E5E5E5] p-4">
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-1">Full-Stack Engineering</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Five years across TypeScript, Node.js, React, and PostgreSQL — building production systems end to end.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="border border-[#E5E5E5] p-4">
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-1">API Design</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">REST and GraphQL APIs designed for clarity, versioned for longevity, and documented for the next developer.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="border border-[#E5E5E5] p-4">
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-1">Developer Experience</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">CI/CD pipelines, Docker containerisation, and tooling that make shipping fast and safe.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="border border-[#E5E5E5] p-4">
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-1">Oslo-Based</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Working remotely across European time zones from Oslo, Norway. Fluent in English, Norwegian.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
